en:
//【童心】
<voice name='童心' class='童心' src='voice/mb02/024vs0960a09'>
//「何ものもかえりみず、我欲のままに生き、
//罰も受けず、満ち足りて命を終えた……
//　世にも<RUBY text='・・・・'>ふざけた</RUBY>男として、のう！」
"Behold, men will say, the greatest scoundrel who ever lived! He held nothing sacred, used the world for his pleasure, and in the end, died fulfilled, having never paid the price!"

